def render_open_source(lang, email):
    zh=lang=='zh';t=lambda a,b:a if zh else b
    base='/memory-music-support/';home=base if zh else base+'en/'
    alternate=base+('en/open-source/' if zh else 'open-source/')
    filename='MemoryMusic-build32-chromaprint-sources.tar.gz'
    digest='f7613de748fea3c1615e64f8cceec2ec18a7ba981775cea98a1350ad28077e00'
    return f'''<!doctype html><html lang="{'zh-CN' if zh else 'en'}"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Memory Music · {t('开源组件与源码','Open-source components')}</title><meta name="description" content="{t('Memory Music 原生音频指纹组件的许可证、对应源码、修改说明和重建工具。','Licenses, corresponding source, modifications and rebuild tools for the native fingerprint component in Memory Music.')}"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'"><link rel="icon" href="{base}icon.png"><link rel="stylesheet" href="{base}product.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="{base}open-source.css"></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">{t('跳至正文','Skip to content')}</a><header class="site-header"><div class="nav-wrap"><a class="brand" href="{home}"><img src="{base}icon.png" width="32" height="32" alt="">Memory Music</a><nav aria-label="{t('主导航','Main navigation')}"><a href="{home}">{t('产品','Overview')}</a><a href="{home}support/">{t('支持','Support')}</a><a class="lang" href="{alternate}">{t('EN','中文')}</a></nav></div></header><main id="main" class="section source-page"><p class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE · BUILD 32 ARCHIVE</p><h1>{t('开源组件与源码。','Open-source components.')}</h1><p class="source-lead">{t('当前发行准备版本（33）已移除音频指纹和在线资料查询组件。其他现用组件的许可可在 App 设置的开源许可中查看。以下仅保留旧版（32）的原生组件源码材料，供历史版本查阅。','The current release candidate (33) removes audio fingerprinting and online metadata lookup components. Licenses for current dependencies are available in the app’s Open-source Licenses. The materials below are retained only for the historical build 32 component.')}</p><section class="source-download"><h2>{t('获取对应源码','Get the corresponding source')}</h2><p>{t('适用于 1.0.0（32）版。归档包含 Chromaprint、Flutter FFI 包装层、编译配置、原始许可、包装层修改补丁和独立 Apple SDK 重建工具。','For version 1.0.0 (32). The archive contains Chromaprint, its Flutter FFI wrapper, build configuration, original licenses, wrapper patches and a standalone Apple SDK rebuild tool.')}</p><a class="pill" href="{base}downloads/{filename}" download>{t('下载源码 · 2.55 MB','Download source · 2.55 MB')} ↓</a><p class="fine">SHA-256</p><code class="source-hash">{digest}</code><p class="fine">{t('归档不包含 Memory Music 业务源码、App 安装包、用户音乐、私人数据库或凭据。上游未参与编译的 test.mp3 测试素材已排除。','No Memory Music application business source, app binaries, user music, private databases or credentials are included. The upstream test.mp3 fixture, which is not compiled into the library, is omitted.')}</p></section><section><h2>{t('组件与许可','Components and licenses')}</h2><div class="source-table"><table><thead><tr><th>{t('组件','Component')}</th><th>{t('许可与说明','License and notes')}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chromaprint</td><td>{t('原生库包含 FFmpeg avresample，因此整体按 LGPL 2.1 考虑；不能仅按外层 MIT 标记判断。','The native library includes FFmpeg avresample and is considered LGPL 2.1 as a whole, rather than MIT-only.')}</td></tr><tr><td>FFmpeg avresample</td><td>LGPL 2.1 or later</td></tr><tr><td>KISS FFT</td><td>{t('BSD 风格许可，原始声明保留在源码和通知中。','BSD-style license, with original notices retained in the source and notices file.')}</td></tr><tr><td>Flutter FFI wrapper</td><td>MIT</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a class="text-link" href="{base}downloads/native-third-party-notices.txt">{t('原生组件完整通知','Native component notices')} ↗</a> · <a class="text-link" href="{base}downloads/LGPL-2.1.txt">GNU LGPL 2.1 ↗</a></p><p class="fine">{t('本页聚焦原生指纹组件。其他随 App 使用的开源组件及许可，可在 App 设置 → App 信息 → 开源许可中查看。','This page focuses on the native fingerprint component. Additional component licenses are available in the app under Settings → App Information → Open-source Licenses.')}</p></section><section><h2>{t('来源与修改','Provenance and modifications')}</h2><p>{t('包装层基于 v0.2.1；原生库使用包装层固定的提交。两端原生源码与该固定来源一致，包装层四个文件的路径、动态库加载和格式变化以补丁随附。','The wrapper is based on v0.2.1, using its pinned native commit. Both native source copies match that pinned source. Patches document path, dynamic loading and formatting changes in four wrapper files.')}</p><ul><li>Wrapper: <code>9b88ebd36e128ea9d93403d34e2549400e31e302</code></li><li>Native: <code>6b13ce3a81ae931e7477c4856a86bece99157cd8</code></li></ul><p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/solearchitect/chromaprint">{t('包装层上游','Wrapper upstream')} ↗</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/acoustid/chromaprint">{t('原生库上游','Native upstream')} ↗</a></p></section><section><h2>{t('独立重建','Standalone rebuild')}</h2><p>{t('在装有官方 Xcode 和 Python 3 的 Mac 上解压归档。选择一个尚不存在的输出目录，运行以下命令；路径中的占位目录请换成自己的位置。','Extract the archive on a Mac with official Xcode and Python 3 installed. Choose an output directory that does not already exist and replace the placeholder paths below with your own.')}</p><pre><code>python3 rebuild.py --platform macos --arch arm64 --output /path/to/new/mac-build
python3 rebuild.py --platform ios --arch arm64 --output /path/to/new/ios-build</code></pre><p>{t('工具只构建原生框架，并检查 24 个公开 C 接口；不签名、不安装、不联网，也不改动已安装的 App。macOS 还可指定 --arch x86_64；iOS 此配方面向 arm64 真机。最低构建目标为 macOS 14 / iOS 17。','The tool builds the native framework and checks its 24 public C functions. It does not sign, install, access the network or modify an installed app. macOS also accepts --arch x86_64; the iOS recipe targets physical arm64 devices. Minimum build targets are macOS 14 and iOS 17.')}</p><p>{t('可选 --marker 参数只在构建副本中改变版本字符串，用于核验实际加载的是修改版；不会改变指纹算法或归档中的原生源文件。','The optional --marker flag changes only a version string in a build copy, helping verify that a modified library is actually loaded. It does not change the fingerprinting algorithm or native source files in the archive.')}</p></section><section><h2>{t('使用修改后的组件','Using a modified component')}</h2><p>{t('旧版（32）通过动态框架加载该组件。macOS 路径为 Contents/Frameworks/chromaprint.framework/chromaprint，iOS 为 Frameworks/chromaprint.framework/chromaprint。适用的开源许可规定这些组件的使用、修改与调试权限，Apple 标准许可协议保留相关开源许可授予的权限。','Historical build 32 loads this component dynamically: Contents/Frameworks/chromaprint.framework/chromaprint on macOS, and Frameworks/chromaprint.framework/chromaprint on iOS. The applicable open-source licenses govern the components’ use, modification and debugging permissions; Apple’s Standard EULA preserves permissions granted by those licenses.')}</p><p>{t('构建结果未签名。任何本地安装需自行具备适用的合法签名与描述文件条件，并使用独立副本。这些历史材料不表示旧版完整 App 的替换、重签名或分发核验已经完成。当前候选版已不包含该组件。','Build output is unsigned. A local installation requires your own lawful signing and provisioning arrangement and a separate copy. These historical materials do not assert completed full-app replacement, re-signing or distribution checks for build 32. The current candidate no longer includes this component.')}</p><p>{t('如对材料有疑问，可联系','Questions about these materials:')} <a class="text-link" href="mailto:{escape(email)}">{escape(email)}</a>{t('。','.')}</p></section></main><footer><div class="footer-inner"><a class="brand" href="{home}">Memory Music</a><nav><a href="{home}privacy/">{t('隐私政策','Privacy')}</a><a href="{home}support/">{t('使用支持','Support')}</a><a href="{home}carplay/">CarPlay</a></nav><small>© 2026 Ken Shane</small></div></footer></body></html>'''
